    "body": "The corrected output → maps → output learner improves H4 association from 25/120 to 33/120 exposed-final answers and from 1/60 to 7/60 complete pairs. This PR preserves that executed improvement, corrects the interpretation and composition instrument, and specifies the next constructive learned-result decoder.\n\nReferences #973, #820, #1139, #962, #963, #964.\n\n## Retained evidence and corrections\n\n- Four seven-file seals and artifact hashes verify. Association attempts 1/2 use identical data/models/results; the selected-value lookup independently reproduces 164/180 development, 112/120 tune and 108/120 final. Three loaded short generations ran, with one correct first answer and degenerate continuation. No broad language result.\n- Zero observed feature aliases does not establish linear infeasibility. The old feature majority table was fitted separately to each split's targets, and the complete predictor also receives local logits. The 21/17 ambiguous-position claim counted distinct labels; actual affected positions are 30/23.\n- Reduced composition used modulo 7 with an order-10 witness and withheld whole operand meanings. Its 0/16 is retained without a familiar-primitive-transfer conclusion. The held-out feature oracle gets 16/16 using held-out labels; a development-fitted table gets 4/16, with no feature overlap.\n- Runtime checkout observations are now distinct from caller-supplied git stamps. Actual source/executable hashes remain the evidence binding.\n\n## Source and roadmap changes\n\nThe version-2 composition fixture uses modulo 10, an actual H4/C120 update witness for every cell and wraparound, and balanced operation×value holdouts with familiar operands/operations/output classes. Prediction records now retain actual per-arm emissions, q0/q1, calibrated loss and target/competitor scores, complete prefixes, and exact selected/intended references; aggregates consume the same events without an extra inference pass. State diagnostics honor NoRead.\n\nSeparate computation competence from unique algebra advantage: both H4 and C120 can implement this cyclic task. Complete computation qualification remains NOT_RUN until generation and designed source/operation interventions execute.\n\nNext: learn lexical decoding of the actual relative/computed result, preserving meaningful query context and distinguishing a valid identity result from NoRead. Separate requested operation from binding relation when needed; then advance dependent Read/Emit/Stop. The brief gives DeepSeek substantive implementation/diagnostic autonomy, complete lifecycle responsibility and prospectively accounted local extensions. It retains structural memory, Hopf/Spin, finite spectral and conditional paired-H4/E8/S7 mechanisms in the broader roadmap.\n\n- [Principal review](https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/blob/463b146a7d1eff39cf2407e2642ff62983c51064/docs/integration/geometric-computation-review-2026-09-21.md)\n- [Complete next research brief](https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/blob/463b146a7d1eff39cf2407e2642ff62983c51064/docs/integration/deepseek-derived-state-decoder-step-2026-09-21.md)\n- [Independent saved-data audit](https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/blob/463b146a7d1eff39cf2407e2642ff62983c51064/docs/evidence/geometric-computation-principal-review-2026-09-21.json)\n- [Executed checks and resources](https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/blob/463b146a7d1eff39cf2407e2642ff62983c51064/docs/evidence/geometric-computation-principal-checks-2026-09-21.json)\n\n## Validation and scope\n\n17 runner tests pass; one older artifact smoke remains explicitly ignored. Five focused fixture/prediction-record tests pass. Offline touched-runner check, formatting, claim wording, three changed JSON documents, 934 relative document targets and diff checks pass. Three pre-existing warnings remain. A second independent source review found no must-fix issue in the repaired boundary.\n\nNo full fit on the repaired fixture or composition generation was run in the principal review. Historical model outcomes and sealed roots remain unchanged. GitHub compatibility checks are acknowledgements, not these local tests.\n\nThe prior component debit is conservatively reconciled by 155900 ms; principal charge is 1481222 ms including final-delivery reserve. Live cumulative 221398372/224900000 ms. Free after checks 51127488512 bytes; principal deleted zero bytes. Earlier DeepSeek cleanup is recorded separately. No paid compute, no owner-checkout mutation, no whole-path D0-b or energy claim.\n",
